title: "PARCE-Cert: Data and Code"
version: 0.3.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22708789
date-released: 2026-09-11
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/zcw8887seu/parce-cert-artifact"
url: "https://github.com/zcw8887seu/parce-cert-artifact/releases/tag/v0.3.0"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Data and code supporting Phase-aware timing certification with selection-valid
  bounds and explicit dependence assumptions. Includes 538,600 session-relative
  physical event records, derived statistical units, 12,000 temporal-dependence
  simulation repetitions, analysis sources and figure inputs. Original code and
  documentation are licensed under MIT; data are licensed under CC BY 4.0, as
  detailed in DATA_LICENSE.md. The physical H3 result remains
  INCONCLUSIVE_CORRELATION_SENSITIVITY.
